# REQ-004: Documentation Indexing via CI
**Priority:** Must Have
**Effort:** Medium
**Risk:** High
**Depends On:** REQ-001
---
## User Story
As a portal maintainer,
I need the documentation to be automatically re-indexed when the portal is updated,
So that the chat bot always answers questions from the most current documentation.
**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Documentation is indexed automatically as part of the GitHub Actions CI pipeline on every portal update
- [ ] Indexing runs as a pre-deployment gate — new index must complete successfully before site deployment proceeds
- [ ] If indexing fails, the CI pipeline is blocked and deployment does not proceed
- [ ] Bot continues serving from the previous index until the new index is successfully built and deployed
- [ ] Indexing completes within 5 minutes (CI timeout threshold) given corpus size of tens of pages
