## Dimension 3: Security
### Applicable Guardrails
- **SEC-001:** TLS encryption for all data in transit
### Security Requirements
- **Authentication:** GitHub Actions pipeline access controlled via repository permissions and secrets
- **Authorisation:** Only CI pipeline may trigger indexing — no public endpoint
- **Encryption in Transit:** TLS 1.2+ for any index artefact transfer
- **Encryption at Rest:** Index artefact stored securely in deployment environment
